bluejetty:00158036:ios.description:
The online ride hailing/private car transportation platform developed by Shouqi Group, which has been dedicated to travel and taxi services for 73 years, provides you and your family with safer, more convenient, and more comfortable high-quality private car and express transportation services.
[Main Services]
Comprehensively covering online ride hailing services such as express, private, international vehicles, buses, Shenzhen Hong Kong Tong, accessibility, short term rental self driving, chartering, conference vehicles, shuttle flights, etc., to meet the daily travel needs of taxis, business vehicles, business trips, and tourism.
Commuting to and from work in the same city, picking up and dropping off parents, family, and students, traveling for business, picking up and dropping off at high-speed rail stations, easily calling a car with just one click when opening the software, and using Shouqi's ride hailing service, we will respond immediately. We will have professional drivers to pick you up, and strict compliance with the safety standards of online ride hailing will provide you and your family/customers with safe and trustworthy convenient travel services.
Instant use - a standby vehicle with unified business standards, available on call, eliminating the need for prolonged waiting on the roadside;
Booking a car - stay in control of the itinerary, and provide you with a full sense of security in scenarios such as airport transfers/important meeting vehicles;
Pick up and drop off - a choice for travel enthusiasts, with air travel spanning the country. Whether it's at midnight or early morning, there are private car level services available for safe pick-up and drop off at high-speed railway terminals;
Calling for a ride on behalf of others - strictly selecting clean and standardized ride hailing services, providing warm and caring services for your family/friends/customers;
Institutional vehicle use - exclusively for enterprises, with more convenient management and use, and flexible on-board invoices and electronic invoices to meet your needs;
Multi day pick-up and drop off - go to work for medical treatment, with a fixed itinerary of 3-15 days, one click appointment is super worry free;
Student car use - full service monitoring, strict driver screening, butler style service, driving safety guarantee, and comprehensive guarantee of student travel safety.
[Contact Information]
Official website: www.01zhuanche.com
Cooperation hotline: 010-65206195
Customer service hotline: 10105678-1
Enterprise email: kf@01zhuanche.com

